OL,3,CMan left 'fighting for his life' after
OL,4,Cserious assault with screwdriver
OL,6,FA 25-year-old man is fighting for his
OL,7,Flife in hospital after being stabbed
OL,8,Fin the head with a screwdriver on a
OL,9,Fbuilding site in Wiltshire.
OL,11,FAt 11am on Thursday 23 July police
OL,12,Fwere called to reports of an incident
OL,13,Fon the Widham Gardens building site in
OL,14,FPurton, near Swindon.
OL,16,FJamie Chappell from Bristol was taken
OL,17,Fto hospital in a life-threatening
OL,18,Fcondition.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
