PN,40602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1785244703
OL,3,CMan left 'fighting for his life' after
OL,4,Cserious assault with screwdriver
OL,6,FHis family have described Jamie as
OL,7,F"one of the kindest, most gentle souls
OL,8,Fyou could ever meet."
OL,10,F"Today Jamie remains critically ill.
OL,11,FHis injuries are not only life
OL,12,Fchanging they are still life
OL,13,Fthreatening.
OL,15,F"Every hour is a battle and our family
OL,16,Fcontinues to live with the
OL,17,Funcertainty, fear and heartbreak that
OL,18,Fno family should ever have to endure.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1785244703
OL,3,CMan left 'fighting for his life' after
OL,4,Cserious assault with screwdriver
OL,6,F"Jamie is the heart of our family and
OL,7,Fthe life and soul of every room he
OL,8,Fwalks into. He is the one who makes
OL,9,Fpeople laugh, lifts others up and
OL,10,Fwould do anything for anyone.
OL,12,F"His kindness, loyalty and love for
OL,13,Fthose around him are what define him
OL,14,Fnot the horrific events that have
OL,15,Fbrought us to this moment.
OL,17,F"Nothing can prepare you for standing
OL,18,Fbeside someone you love, not knowing
OL,19,Fwhat tomorrow will bring. Our lives
OL,20,Fhave been turned upside down in an
OL,21,Finstant."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
