OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1785244703
OL,3,CMan left 'fighting for his life' after
OL,4,Cserious assault with screwdriver
OL,6,FJames Denys, 36, of Ravensdale, East
OL,7,FWichel, appeared before Swindon
OL,8,FMagistrates' Court and was remanded in
OL,9,Fcustody. He is due to appear at
OL,10,FSwindon Crown Court on 21 August.
OL,12,FA second man, aged 36, was arrested on
OL,13,Fsuspicion of assisting an offender and
OL,14,Fhas since been released on bail.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/4
